// endpoint_select_response_text.proto — SelectResponseText: hold or clear the
// words highlighted in a final response. FEED section.
//
// THE DAEMON IS THE ONLY HOLDER of a workspace's highlight. While words of a
// final response are highlighted, the next prompt the user sends is NOT a
// turn: the daemon asks the shim to revise that response so it answers the
// prompt about those words (shim.v1.ReviseResponse), answers the submission
// `response_revising`, and clears the highlight. Nothing new appears in the
// feed: the response's own bubble is redrawn with the revision.
//
// The webapp reports the highlight as the reader's text selection settles
// (a drag-select released, a keyboard extension of it) and clears it when the
// selection leaves the response or collapses.

